SPOILER FOLLOWS ......







	The Level refers to the charcters experience level and not the dungeon
level. Giving a like-aligned priest 400*Exp. level reduces your AC by 1 or 
more. I am not sure of the exact numbers, but in my experience, the first
time I give gold, my AC reduces by 2 to 4. Every time after that, it reduces
by 1. The reduction is not by enchanting your armour, but the character AC.
The message you get should be something like -

	"Thy devotion has been rewarded"


